---
layout: product.njk
og_type: website
pagination:
  data: liveApps
  size: 1
  alias: sport
permalink: "{{ sport.downloadPage }}"
eleventyComputed:
  title: "RosterWise™ {{ sport.name }} — College {{ sport.name }} Recruiting Intelligence App | $40 One-Time"
  description: "RosterWise™ {{ sport.name }} analyzes every college {{ sport.name | lower }} program — roster depth by {{ sport.analysisAxis }}, class-year gaps, recruiting patterns, and personalized My RosterFit™ scores. {{ sport.subtext }}. One-time $40, lifetime access."
  breadcrumbs:
    - text: Home
      url: /
    - text: "{{ sport.name }}"
      url: "{{ sport.hub }}"
    - text: "Get the App"
---
{% set axis = sport.analysisAxis %}

<!-- Hero -->
<section class="product-hero">
  <div class="product-hero-inner">
    <a href="{{ sport.appStoreUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="text-decoration: none;">
      <img src="{{ sport.logo }}" alt="RosterWise {{ sport.name }} App" width="180" height="180" style="border-radius: 24px; box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(0,0,0,0.3); margin-bottom: 24px;" loading="eager">
    </a>
    <h1>RosterWise&trade; {{ sport.name }}</h1>
    <p class="tagline">Deep roster intelligence for college {{ sport.name | lower }} recruiting families — in a dedicated {{ sport.name | lower }} app.</p>
    <p style="color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6); font-size: 14px; margin-top: -8px;">{{ sport.subtext }}</p>
    <div class="product-price-badge">
      <strong>$40 one-time</strong> &mdash; No subscriptions &middot; No ads &middot; Lifetime access
    </div>

    <div class="product-store-btns" style="margin-top: 28px; justify-content: center;">
      <a href="{{ sport.appStoreUrl }}" class="store-btn" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="24" viewBox="0 0 384 512" fill="currentColor"><path d="M318.7 268.7c-.2-36.7 16.4-64.4 50-84.8-18.8-26.9-47.2-41.7-84.7-44.6-35.5-2.8-74.3 20.7-88.5 20.7-15 0-49.4-19.7-76.4-19.7C63.3 141.2 4 184.8 4 273.5c0 26.2 4.8 53.3 14.4 81.2 12.8 36.7 59 126.7 107.2 125.2 25.2-.6 43-17.9 75.8-17.9 31.8 0 48.3 17.9 76.4 17.9 48.6-.7 90.4-82.5 102.6-119.3-65.2-30.7-61.7-90-61.7-91.9zm-56.6-164.2c27.3-32.4 24.8-61.9 24-72.5-24.1 1.4-52 16.4-67.9 34.9-17.5 19.8-27.8 44.3-25.6 71.9 26.1 2 49.9-11.4 69.5-34.3z"/></svg>
        <span>Download RosterWise {{ sport.name }}</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- What it analyzes -->
<section class="product-section product-section--navy">
  <div class="container">
    <h2>What RosterWise&trade; {{ sport.name }} shows you</h2>
    <p>It goes beyond school lists. RosterWise applies <a href="/roster-intelligence/" style="color: var(--gold); font-weight: 600;">roster intelligence</a> — systematic analysis of who is actually on every college {{ sport.name | lower }} roster — so your family can see where your athlete fits.</p>

    <div class="feature-grid">
      <div class="feature-card">
        <h3>Depth by {{ axis | capitalize }}</h3>
        <p>See how every program is built by {{ axis }} — where a lineup spot is genuinely open versus stacked with returning starters.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <h3>Class-Year Gaps</h3>
        <p>Who occupies the spot your athlete plays, and when do they graduate? A graduating senior signals very different opportunity than a returning underclassman.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <h3>Recruiting Geography &amp; Pathways</h3>
        <p>What states, regions, clubs, and high schools each program recruits from — so you understand the pipelines behind every roster.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <h3>My RosterFit&trade; Personalized Scoring</h3>
        <p>Enter your athlete's profile and RosterFit scores every program by how well they align with the actual roster — a personalized fit analysis, not a generic match list.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p style="text-align: center; margin-top: 28px;">
      <a href="{{ sport.hub }}" style="color: var(--gold); font-weight: 600;">Explore college {{ sport.name | lower }} recruiting &rarr;</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Pricing -->
<section class="product-section product-section--cream">
  <div class="container" style="text-align: center;">
    <h2>Real intelligence. Fair price. No tricks.</h2>
    <p style="max-width: 640px; margin: 0 auto 20px;">Paid recruiting services charge hundreds for generic match lists. RosterWise {{ sport.name }} gives you deeper analysis — actual roster intelligence at the program level — for less than a single training session.</p>
    <div class="product-price-badge" style="margin-bottom: 16px;">
      <strong>$40</strong> &mdash; one-time purchase &middot; lifetime access
    </div>
    <p style="font-size: 15px; color: var(--text-muted); max-width: 540px; margin: 0 auto;">No subscriptions. No monthly fees. No ads. No account required. Your data stays on your device.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Final CTA -->
<section class="product-final-cta">
